# Secrets. Deliberately not anchored with a leading slash: that would cover the repository root
# only, and rig runs exercises with --env=<file>, so a .env can legitimately sit in a
# subdirectory. A .env anywhere in this tree holds live credentials and must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

/.idea
/.phpunit.cache
/CLAUDE.local.md
